#: desc: The parser state after each line of Makefile.padding
#: trace
test/fixtures/Makefile.padding
#: stdout
== test/fixtures/Makefile.padding
   1 . R   0  0 | t: ## A target with a short name
   1 ========== => target:t
   2 . R   0  0 |
   3 . R   0  0 | longer-target-name: ## More characters
   3 ========== => target:longer-target-name
   4 . R   0  0 |
   5 . R   1  0 | ## And the winner is ...
   6 . -   0  0 | A_______________________ := 1
   6 ========== => variable:A_______________________
